  "covered": [
    "Actual successful Skill receipts required; model readiness claim alone insufficient",
    "Same configured CLI alias/workdir, fresh session, bounded timeout/turns/budget and shared daily accounting",
    "Startup hook denies business reads/writes, MCP calls, shell, agents and tool discovery",
    "Only registered allowed MCP connections considered; cloud connector name normalization; unknown/pending never reported connected",
    "Optional continue explicit and nonpersistent; essential checks never bypassed",
    "Direct run and start both gated; no intake/worker after failure; Socket Mode ready required",
    "Stop during Slack/AI checks, atomic start transition, lock/handler cleanup",
    "Read-only status exposes sanitized stage; no AI calls or credential details",
    "Owned fake CLI process verifies stream/policy/budget integration"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Fake Slack/engine and synthetic CLI; no real Claude model call or company credentials",
    "MCP init snapshot only; connected transport is not business-query authorization",
    "Missing connector metadata stays unverified; no invented registration from default tools",
    "Model may fail to load skills within bounded probe; actual company acceptance still required",
    "Existing research/evidence checks remain in every question"
  ],
